end="0:51.358">ゼン</span><span begin="0:51.358" end="0:51.718">ト</span><span begin="0:51.718" end="0:52.238">いい</span><span begin="0:52.238" end="0:52.698">ね</span><span begin="0:52.698" end="0:53.038">の</span><span begin="0:53.038" end="0:53.938">数</span></p><p begin="0:54.260" end="0:58.880" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.260" end="0:54.380">身</span><span begin="0:54.380" end="0:54.720">に</span><span begin="0:54.720" end="0:55.270">纏う</span><span begin="0:55.270" end="0:56.010">全</span><span begin="0:56.010" end="0:56.250">て</span><span begin="0:56.250" end="0:56.710">も</span><span begin="0:56.710" end="0:56.830">の</span><span begin="0:56.830" end="0:57.170">さ</span><span begin="0:57.170" end="0:57.370">し</span><span begin="0:57.370" end="0:57.590">に</span><span begin="0:57.590" end="0:57.730">し</span><span begin="0:57.730" end="0:58.880">て</span></p><p begin="0:59.551" end="1:03.091" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.551" end="0:59.881">必</span><span begin="0:59.881" end="1:00.231">死</span><span begin="1:00.231" end="1:00.781">に</span><span begin="1:00.781" end="1:01.041">生</span><span begin="1:01.041" end="1:01.361">き</span><span begin="1:01.361" end="1:01.591">て</span><span begin="1:01.591" end="1:03.091">る</span></p><p begin="1:03.699" end="1:08.839" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.699" end="1:03.879">馬</span><span begin="1:03.879" end="1:04.079">鹿</span><span begin="1:04.079" end="1:04.299">み</span><span begin="1:04.299" end="1:05.459">た</span><span begin="1:05.459" end="1:06.069">い</span><span begin="1:06.379" end="1:06.779">こう</span><span begin="1:06.779" end="1:07.049">は</span><span begin="1:07.049" end="1:07.449">な</span><span begin="1:07.449" end="1:07.579">り</span><span begin="1:07.579" end="1:07.889">た</span><span begin="1:07.889" end="1:08.149">く</span><span begin="1:08.149" end="1:08.839">ない</span></p><p begin="1:09.052" end="1:14.052" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.052" end="1:09.21